      <data key="d4">Govt proposes mandatory blending in ATF from 2027; draws up sustainable aviation fuel policy The government has proposed that airlines will have to start mandatorily blending of sustainable aviation fuel and it will be flagged of with 1 per cent from 2027. A draft policy circulated by the civil aviation ministry has said that at least 90 per cent of the annual SAF requirement for international flights has to be sourced from India.</data>
